## 6.3 Headline and deck

Typography should be expressive.

Make the headline a major design element.

Pay attention to:

- Line breaks.
- Maximum text width.
- Visual weight.
- Line height.
- Chinese character spacing.
- English title wrapping.
- Relationship to the hero image.

The deck should communicate the actual event succinctly.

Avoid excessive technical metadata beside the headline.

